title: Payers › Workflow Builder › Test a workflow
route: /payers/summit?tab=builder
intro: The 'Test' button takes the open workflow to Test Workflow with it already selected. The edits on screen are saved as a draft first, because the test runs the saved workflow, not the picture.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Test' in the bar"
decision d1 "Unsaved changes on a workflow that is not archived?"
store st1 "The draft is saved first\nVersion line describes the change"
toast t1 "'Draft saved'"
process p1 "The address becomes ?tab=test&workflow=the-id\nThe view switches to Test Workflow"
screen tw "Test Workflow opens with that workflow in 'Workflow to test'\n'You chose this workflow.'\nA draft is labelled 'Draft: not used for cases yet' in the results"
end e1 "The workflow is ready to run on a made-up case"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Test Workflow › Run a test case"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| st1 --> t1 --> p1
d1 -->|No| p1
p1 --> tw --> e1 --> g1
